=== intro

The route passes through a debris field—asteroids, yes, but also wreckage. Shattered hulls. The remains of a station, torn apart by something or someone centuries ago.

Standard navigation would take hours to thread through safely. A skilled pilot could cut through faster, but the margin for error is razor-thin.

* [Take the safe route]
  ~ supplies -= 2
  ~ chronicle "Careful Navigation"
    Took the long way through the debris field. Slow but safe.
  -> END

* [Thread the needle] { crew.navigation }
  ~ morale += 5
  ~ chronicle "Skilled Flying"
    Threaded through the debris field like a needle through cloth. The navigator earned their keep today.
  -> END

* [Risk a direct path]
  ~ damage hull 8
  ~ chronicle "Debris Damage"
    Took a few hits cutting through the field. Hull integrity compromised, but we saved time.
  -> END
